```Title: Kerberos TGT Issued Without Pre-Authentication (4768) (raw Windows Security events)```
```ATT&CK: T1558.004 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 909267c6-a422-46bc-a8b0-18b7fc99e83d```
```Data source: Windows Security EventCode 4768 (Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Windows). Change index to where your Security logs live.```
```False positives: Accounts that legitimately have pre-authentication disabled (some Unix/Kerberos interoperability setups); list and remove them```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=wineventlog source IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Security", "WinEventLog:Security")
(EventCode=4768 PreAuthType=0 Status="0x0")
| table _time host TargetUserName TargetDomainName IpAddress Status PreAuthType TicketEncryptionType
